---
description: Testing and CI guidance
globs:
  - "tests/**/*.ts"
  - "src/tests/**/*.ts"
  - "**/*.test.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Unit tests
  - Test pure utilities and type-level logic without network I/O.
  - Mock providers at the adapter boundary; verify normalized shapes, not provider internals.

- Integration tests
  - Test critical handlers and streaming paths end-to-end with fixtures.
  - Use deterministic inputs; record/replay where live provider calls are impractical.

- CI hygiene
  - Keep tests parallelizable. Avoid shared global state.
  - Fast feedback: mark slow suites and run them conditionally.

